      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Medium-density fibreboard (MDF) is an engineered wood product made by breaking down hardwood or softwood residuals into wood fibres, often in a defibrator, combining it with wax and a resin binder, and forming it into panels by applying high temperature and pressure. It is a manufactured product composed of wood fibers mixed with resins and wax, and pressed into flat panels under high temperatures and pressure. MDF is inexpensive, durable, and a good choice for many woodworking and carpentry projects.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "中密度纤维板（MDF）是一种工程木制品，通常在脱纤器中将硬木或软木剩余物分解成木纤维，再与蜡和树脂粘合剂混合，通过高温高压将其制成板材。中密度纤维板是一种制成品，由木质纤维与树脂和蜡混合，在高温高压下压制成平板。中密度纤维板价格低廉、经久耐用，是许多木工和木匠项目的上佳选择。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
